{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":519889,\"title\":\"A Winter Tale\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A Soviet musical animated film about how forest animals with Santa Claus decided to celebrate the New Year.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8BP4jYM63urMz6m8HV1vzwucBnK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":1945,\"runtime\":13,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"SU\",\"name\":\"Soviet Union\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Ivan Ivanov-Vano\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":128291,\"name\":\"Ivan Ivanov-Vano\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jfZVkps4MPNusXrO8kpF4BpFbUg.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":791523,\"title\":\"Wildwood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snFM00mpNAfUzUtkdEW0uDEvXA0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sl5NJ1vtyhP9Vr88bB4blULsJYp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prue and her classmate Curtis are drawn into a magical forest filled with enchanted creatures, loyal allies, and formidable adversaries as they embark on a desperate quest to rescue Prue's abducted baby brother from a murder of crows led by a mysterious woman named Alexandra.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14836,\"title\":\"Coraline\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4jeFXQYytChdZYE9JYO7Un87IlW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hofnlIyF6bePkgQOpcuRWLvzf15.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Wandering her rambling old house in her boring new town, 11-year-old Coraline discovers a hidden door to a strangely idealized version of her life. In order to stay in the fantasy, she must make a frighteningly real sacrifice.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1226863,\"title\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having thwarted Bowser's previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir's crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1007757,\"title\":\"Swapped\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tHhxWxge06goXU6ZQH1hj7vK8Hd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zMwhWailP1WY7sb6AoE6b8ugoy.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A small woodland creature and a majestic bird, two natural sworn enemies of the Valley, magically trade places and set off on an adventure of a lifetime to switch back. Their journey soon uncovers a greater threat—one that could endanger not only their species, but the entire valley they call home.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":803796,\"title\":\"KPop Demon Hunters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w3Bi0wygeFQctn6AqFTwhGNXRwL.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren't selling out stadiums, they're using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":360920,\"title\":\"The Grinch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Al7DMUp8bqUN4JwXVNxfJYyv5cH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lWIYxYEqWi8j3ZloxXntw3ImBo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Grinch hatches a scheme to ruin Christmas when the residents of Whoville plan their annual holiday celebration. But a certain little who might change things.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1185806,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cxXSF4aY5N2cOGwaga5OnpPFHzk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dY4LyVSvjk9dN20YsxuouaMIMox.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Paw Patrol lands on a mysterious dinosaur island after a storm, where they meet Rex, a stranded pup. When Humdinger's reckless mining triggers a volcano, the team faces their biggest rescue mission yet to save the island.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2062,\"title\":\"Ratatouille\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t3vaWRPSf6WjDSamIkKDs1iQWna.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zeoaHdXRDd5IoUiMVsNhwTZm78B.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In one of Paris's finest restaurants, Remy, a determined young rat, dreams of becoming a renowned French chef. Torn between his family's wishes and his true calling, Remy and his pal Linguini set in motion a hilarious chain of events that turns the City of Lights upside down.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":585,\"title\":\"Monsters, Inc.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wFSpyMsp7H0ttERbxY7Trlv8xry.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7VbRPlev1bRfKvTxr98erw5T7B.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lovable Sulley and his wisecracking sidekick Mike Wazowski are the top scare team at Monsters, Inc., the scream-processing factory in Monstropolis. When a little girl named Boo wanders into their world, it's the monsters who are scared silly, and it's up to Sulley and Mike to keep her out of sight and get her back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"DBSj1MKwx6A\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"1qJM8OSAxLY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"PzomDNgbKU4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}